description = "Five lessons introduce the complete Bug hive, followed by Nestbreaker Matron or The First Queen. Leave marked volumes and destroy brood parents to create breathing room."
combat_hint = "Five waves, then a Bug boss. Leave marked corridors before a Devourer commits.\nDestroy Broodmothers and Hive Queens to clear their broods. Leave fixed spore spheres before each pulse."
